{"id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-analytical-hierarchy.md","title":"The Lightface Analytical Hierarchy","display":"df-analytical-hierarchy — The Lightface Analytical Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy","aliases":["68-df-analytical-hierarchy"],"display":"df-analytical-hierarchy — The Lightface Analytical Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§19 definitions and 19.1 pp.71–73 / PDF 80–82","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-and-prefix-correspondence-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-analytical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-analytical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analytical-hierarchy — The Lightface Analytical Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b56f83b0418112cc\" href=\"?note=b56f83b0418112cc\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§19 definitions and 19.1 pp.71–73 / PDF 80–82"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-and-prefix-correspondence-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{m,k}\">\\(X_{m,k}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}\\)</span> 见直接依赖。下式对层数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 同时递归定义全部混合元数的类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle\">\\(\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle\\)</span> 把新实变量放在已有实变量之后，数元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 保持不变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^{1,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{1,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^{1,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{1,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{n+1}^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{n+1}^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Analytical}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Analytical}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §19，印刷 pp.71–73 / PDF pp.80–82，以递归矩阵、任意数和实量词前缀定义 analytical，并由 19.1 把实量词移至最前。这里以算术关系为第 0 层，再递归投影一个实变量，等价地记录其正层级；第 0 层是本目录辅助约定。所有自由实输入都属于关系的显式变量，定义中没有偷偷固定额外实常元，因而这些是 lightface 类。§20 的允许固定实参数的 projective 类应另行命名，不能直接与本定义合并。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"b56f83b0418112cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,k,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0^{1,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{1,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{n+1}^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_{n+1}^{1,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{1,(m+1,k)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal B\\;((\\vec\\alpha\\,^{\\frown}\\langle\\beta\\rangle,\\vec x)\\in Q))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Analytical}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}).","display":true}],"bytes":2316,"backlinks":[{"id":"150b567749c83f49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k,r,n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$，$Q\\subseteq X_{m+r,k}$。$\\mathcal B=\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}$、$X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；无固定实参数的 $\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。$\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m$、$\\vec\\beta\\in\\mathcal B^r$、$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$；$\\frown$ 为有限元组连接，$r=0$ 时 $\\vec\\beta=()$。下式引入 section 算子 $\\operatorname{Sec}_{m,k}^r$ 及带任意有限实参数的粗体关系类。"},{"id":"c701ad2d561329ae","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X=X_{m,k}$。$\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}$ 见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。下式引入集合投影算子 $E_{m,k},A_{m,k}$，其参数 $R\\subseteq X_{m,k+1}$；$\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle$ 为追加数输入。"},{"id":"e5bbc43941063123","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X_{m,k}=\\mathcal B^m\\times\\mathbb N^k$，$\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle e\\rangle$ 为末尾追加自然数索引。解析类见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"7328203796df129b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k,n\\in\\mathbb N$；各元数的 $\\Sigma_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Pi_n^{1,(m,k)},\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}$ 及第零层算术辅助约定见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"0ebe52081fac785e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k,r,l\\in\\mathbb N$，$R\\subseteq X_{m,k}$，$S\\subseteq X_{r,l}$，$R\\le_{\\mathrm{eff}}^{(m,k;r,l)}S$。有效代入见 [[68-df-effective-real-reducibility]]，解析类见 [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"混合元数与层级：[[68-df-baire-space]] → [[68-df-real-machine]] → [[68-df-recursive-real-function]] → [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]] → [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]] → [[68-thm-separation-theorem]] → [[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]。有限二进制串另记为 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，不与 Baire 空间 $\\mathcal B$ 混用。"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","b56f83b0418112cc"]}